; Drivetrain-Teleop: clear any latched drivetrain fault, then power the drivetrain on.
;
; Every command is R00:00:00: each one goes out the moment the previous one answers, so the
; whole sequence runs in milliseconds. Any command that fails stops the sequence there.
; The ON step is refused (VALIDATION_ERROR, PowerOnRejected event) while the E-STOP is engaged.
; CLEAR_FAULT is refused (EXECUTION_ERROR) while a drive over-temperature persists.
R00:00:00 rp2350Deployment.fpManager.CLEAR_FAULT DRIVETRAIN
R00:00:00 rp2350Deployment.subsystemManager.SET_DRIVETRAIN_POWER_STATE ON
